# Debian package control file for callwarden-agent
# Task: T-1783983162956-b2a8
# 角色 agent: cw-agent + systemd user unit + client（设计 §8.1 / §4.4）
# __VERSION__ / __ARCH__ 由 build_packages.sh 从 release/version.toml 注入

Package: callwarden-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Call Warden Team <team@callwarden.dev>
Description: Call Warden - Per-UID Agent (cw-agent + systemd user unit)
 Per-UID agent running as the logged-in user. Reads the user's own
 workspaces and reports to the system daemon via UDS/FD.
 .
 Includes:
  - cw-agent CLI
  - systemd user unit (callwarden-agent.service)
  - depends on callwarden-client (shared connection/MCP proxy)
Depends: callwarden-client (= __VERSION__), libc6 (>= 2.17)
